        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's nighttime, you're driving down a dark road, heading to a Halloween party your friends have organized at a remote farm.  But the farm carries a legend stained with despair. And someone is watching you from afar...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What begins as a celebration soon turns into blood-soaked horror.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A 90’s-Inspired Slasher Survival Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Scarlet Harvest is a horror survival game inspired by classic 90s slasher films. Step into tense, atmospheric locations pulled straight from a late-night horror flick. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/ae1b11bbea184a6fb765047a4903bfb6.poster.avif?t=1772472619\" width=640 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/ae1b11bbea184a6fb765047a4903bfb6.webm?t=1772472619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/ae1b11bbea184a6fb765047a4903bfb6.mp4?t=1772472619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A silent gas station in the middle of the woods, sinister cornfields, ramshackle barns, and a remote farm hiding more than one terrible secret.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enjoy the Party… While You Can</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before the nightmare unfolds, you’re free to live the moment. Dance with your friends. Grab a beer. Talk, explore, and light a few firecrackers under the Halloween sky. But when the horror begins, there’s no standing still. You’ll have to run for your life. Fight back against your enemies. Survive the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/86f3e9a4dc06f8cf0fe2f74daa4a5559.poster.avif?t=1772472619\" width=640 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/86f3e9a4dc06f8cf0fe2f74daa4a5559.webm?t=1772472619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/86f3e9a4dc06f8cf0fe2f74daa4a5559.mp4?t=1772472619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With dark environments, constant tension, and moments of gore, <i>The Scarlet Harvest </i>delivers a slasher-inspired horror experience where not everyone makes it to morning.</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's nighttime, you're driving down a dark road, heading to a Halloween party your friends have organized at a remote farm.  But the farm carries a legend stained with despair. And someone is watching you from afar...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What begins as a celebration soon turns into blood-soaked horror.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A 90’s-Inspired Slasher Survival Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Scarlet Harvest is a horror survival game inspired by classic 90s slasher films. Step into tense, atmospheric locations pulled straight from a late-night horror flick. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/ae1b11bbea184a6fb765047a4903bfb6.poster.avif?t=1772472619\" width=640 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/ae1b11bbea184a6fb765047a4903bfb6.webm?t=1772472619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/ae1b11bbea184a6fb765047a4903bfb6.mp4?t=1772472619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A silent gas station in the middle of the woods, sinister cornfields, ramshackle barns, and a remote farm hiding more than one terrible secret.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enjoy the Party… While You Can</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before the nightmare unfolds, you’re free to live the moment. Dance with your friends. Grab a beer. Talk, explore, and light a few firecrackers under the Halloween sky. But when the horror begins, there’s no standing still. You’ll have to run for your life. Fight back against your enemies. Survive the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/86f3e9a4dc06f8cf0fe2f74daa4a5559.poster.avif?t=1772472619\" width=640 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/86f3e9a4dc06f8cf0fe2f74daa4a5559.webm?t=1772472619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/86f3e9a4dc06f8cf0fe2f74daa4a5559.mp4?t=1772472619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With dark environments, constant tension, and moments of gore, <i>The Scarlet Harvest </i>delivers a slasher-inspired horror experience where not everyone makes it to morning.</strong></p>",
